  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Indonesia 2025 &#x2013; enhancing the humanitarian and protection environment for refugee arrivals in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of IOM&apos;s wider regional response in addressing the needs of the displaced Rohingya population, and as a part of a coordinated effort with the Government of Indonesia, international partners, and civil society, through this project, IOM aims to enhance the Government of Indonesia&#x2019;s capacity in protection, fulfilment of refugees&#x2019; basic rights, and strengthening the refugee reception system in Indonesia. More specifically, the project aims to mitigate the refugees&#x2019; vulnerabilities in accordance with established international humanitarian principles while also adhering to the national regulations governing the handling of refugees in Indonesia.</narrative>
  </description>
